  "verseCount": 28,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "13",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JOB 13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "13",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lo, mine eye hath seen all",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "this",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.13.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.13.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", mine ear hath heard and understood it.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "What ye know,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "the same",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.13.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.13.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "do I know also: I",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "am",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.13.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.13.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "not inferior unto you.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Surely I would speak to the Almighty, and I desire to reason with God.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But ye",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.13.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.13.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "forgers of lies, ye",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.13.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.13.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "all physicians of no value.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "O that ye would altogether hold your peace! and it should be your wisdom.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hear now my reasoning, and hearken to the pleadings of my lips.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Will ye speak wickedly for God? and talk deceitfully for him?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Will ye accept his person? will ye contend for God?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Is it good that he should search you out? or as one man mocketh another, do ye",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "so",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.13.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.13.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mock him?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He will surely reprove you, if ye do secretly accept persons.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shall not his excellency make you afraid? and his dread fall upon you?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Your remembrances",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.13.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.13.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "like unto ashes, your bodies to bodies of clay.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.13.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hold your peace, let me alone, that I may speak, and let come on me what",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "will",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.13.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.13.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wherefore do I take my flesh in my teeth, and put my life in mine hand?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Though he slay me, yet will I trust in him: but I will maintain mine own ways before him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He also",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "shall be",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.13.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.13.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "my salvation: for an hypocrite shall not come before him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hear diligently my speech, and my declaration with your ears.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Behold now, I have ordered",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "my",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.13.18",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.13.18"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "cause; I know that I shall be justified.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Who",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.13.19",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.13.19"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "he",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.13.19",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.13.19"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "will plead with me? for now, if I hold my tongue, I shall give up the ghost.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Only do not two",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "things",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.13.20",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.13.20"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "unto me: then will I not hide myself from thee.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Withdraw thine hand far from me: and let not thy dread make me afraid.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then call thou, and I will answer: or let me speak, and answer thou me.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.13.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "How many",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.13.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.13.23",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.13.23"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mine iniquities and sins? make me to know my transgression and my sin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.13.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 13:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wherefore hidest thou thy face, and holdest me for thine enemy?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.13.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.13.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 13:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wilt thou break a leaf driven to and fro? and wilt thou pursue the dry stubble?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.13.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.13.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 13:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For thou writest bitter things against me, and makest me to possess the iniquities of my youth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.13.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.13.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 13:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thou puttest my feet also in the stocks, and lookest narrowly unto all my paths; thou settest a print upon the heels of my feet.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.13.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.13.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.13.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.13.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 13:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he, as a rotten thing, consumeth, as a garment that is moth eaten.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.13.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.13.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
